<view class="page"><view class="title">查询记录</view><view class="note">仅会员可保存历史。会员开通暂未收费。</view><button wx:if="{{!member}}" class="secondary" bindtap="login">登录查看查询记录</button><view wx:if="{{!member}}" class="note">不登录也可返回首页继续查询。</view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="note">暂无记录</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="section">{{item.title}}</view><view class="note">{{item.date}} · {{item.created}}</view></view></view>
